{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00962",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 1.03,
      "end_seconds": 7.1,
      "duration_seconds": 6.07,
      "text": "Is it Siobhan Brennan? Siobhan, with the two b's? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 9.8,
      "end_seconds": 22.32,
      "duration_seconds": 12.52,
      "text": "That's me, doctor, one b and two n's, but sure, you're close enough. Isn't it a grand morning for a broken wrist!"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 23.43,
      "end_seconds": 32.86,
      "duration_seconds": 9.43,
      "text": "Ha. So, this is your fracture clinic check, the cast comes off next week. How's it been going? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 34.36,
      "end_seconds": 51.51,
      "duration_seconds": 17.15,
      "text": "Grand, mostly. It was my own fault, I came off the bike on the Phoenix Park road, hit a pothole, my husband never lets me forget it. Five weeks ago now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 53.32,
      "end_seconds": 57.92,
      "duration_seconds": 4.6,
      "text": "Five weeks. Any itching under the cast?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 60.16,
      "end_seconds": 67.16,
      "duration_seconds": 7.0,
      "text": "Desperately. I've been poking a knitting needle down it, don't tell the nurse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 68.38,
      "end_seconds": 73.16,
      "duration_seconds": 4.78,
      "text": "I won't. Any swelling in the fingers?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 75.66,
      "end_seconds": 81.9,
      "duration_seconds": 6.24,
      "text": "A bit in the evenings, they feel fat, like sausages."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 84.26,
      "end_seconds": 87.0,
      "duration_seconds": 2.74,
      "text": "Are the fingers stiff?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 88.33,
      "end_seconds": 92.81,
      "duration_seconds": 4.48,
      "text": "Very. I can barely make a fist."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 95.05,
      "end_seconds": 97.95,
      "duration_seconds": 2.9,
      "text": "Any aching at night?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 100.0,
      "end_seconds": 105.58,
      "duration_seconds": 5.58,
      "text": "In the wrist, yes, when I lie on it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 108.04,
      "end_seconds": 111.23,
      "duration_seconds": 3.19,
      "text": "Any numbness in the hand?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 112.01,
      "end_seconds": 113.67,
      "duration_seconds": 1.66,
      "text": "No numbness."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 115.92,
      "end_seconds": 118.46,
      "duration_seconds": 2.54,
      "text": "Pins and needles?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 120.37,
      "end_seconds": 122.07,
      "duration_seconds": 1.7,
      "text": "No, none."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 123.44,
      "end_seconds": 129.67,
      "duration_seconds": 6.23,
      "text": "Any sores, or rubbing under the edge of the cast?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 131.82,
      "end_seconds": 135.8,
      "duration_seconds": 3.98,
      "text": "No sores. I looked with a torch."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 136.97,
      "end_seconds": 140.35,
      "duration_seconds": 3.38,
      "text": "Any smell coming from it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 141.41,
      "end_seconds": 147.7,
      "duration_seconds": 6.29,
      "text": "No smell. I put my nose right up to it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 148.69,
      "end_seconds": 151.18,
      "duration_seconds": 2.49,
      "text": "What are you taking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 152.61,
      "end_seconds": 169.09,
      "duration_seconds": 16.48,
      "text": "Paracetamol, maybe 1 gram, when it's sore. And a big white chewy tablet for the bones, I don't know what it's called, my mother takes the same one. And omeprazole, 20 mg, in the morning."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 171.63,
      "end_seconds": 176.66,
      "duration_seconds": 5.03,
      "text": "We'll find the chewable on your record. Any allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 177.89,
      "end_seconds": 181.14,
      "duration_seconds": 3.25,
      "text": "None at all. No allergies."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 182.19,
      "end_seconds": 183.61,
      "duration_seconds": 1.42,
      "text": "Medical history?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 185.07,
      "end_seconds": 190.02,
      "duration_seconds": 4.95,
      "text": "A bit of thin bones, osteopenia, and acid reflux."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 192.33,
      "end_seconds": 193.76,
      "duration_seconds": 1.43,
      "text": "Any operations?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 196.1,
      "end_seconds": 198.74,
      "duration_seconds": 2.64,
      "text": "A caesarean, in 2015."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 199.75,
      "end_seconds": 203.65,
      "duration_seconds": 3.9,
      "text": "Bone problems in the family?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 204.6,
      "end_seconds": 207.29,
      "duration_seconds": 2.69,
      "text": "My mother has osteoporosis."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 208.86,
      "end_seconds": 212.11,
      "duration_seconds": 3.25,
      "text": "What do you do?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 213.76,
      "end_seconds": 221.77,
      "duration_seconds": 8.01,
      "text": "Primary school teacher. Thirty small children and one broken wrist, you can imagine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 223.83,
      "end_seconds": 226.71,
      "duration_seconds": 2.88,
      "text": "And the cycling, how often?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 228.42,
      "end_seconds": 231.89,
      "duration_seconds": 3.47,
      "text": "Three times a week, before this."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 243.53,
      "end_seconds": 249.53,
      "duration_seconds": 6.0,
      "text": "Let me check you. Blood pressure 124 over 76, pulse 70."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 251.76,
      "end_seconds": 255.24,
      "duration_seconds": 3.48,
      "text": "Is that all right? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 265.67,
      "end_seconds": 269.69,
      "duration_seconds": 4.02,
      "text": "Perfect. Let me look at the cast."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 272.22,
      "end_seconds": 274.43,
      "duration_seconds": 2.21,
      "text": "Be gentle. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 275.84,
      "end_seconds": 280.95,
      "duration_seconds": 5.11,
      "text": "The cast is intact and dry, no cracks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 282.93,
      "end_seconds": 287.24,
      "duration_seconds": 4.31,
      "text": "I've been very careful in the shower. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 289.48,
      "end_seconds": 295.07,
      "duration_seconds": 5.59,
      "text": "And the fingers are warm, pink, with good colour."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 297.86,
      "end_seconds": 300.9,
      "duration_seconds": 3.04,
      "text": "They're a bit puffy. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 301.7,
      "end_seconds": 308.4,
      "duration_seconds": 6.7,
      "text": "Wiggle them for me. I can see you move all five fingers well."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 309.94,
      "end_seconds": 313.36,
      "duration_seconds": 3.42,
      "text": "There, like a pianist. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 315.19,
      "end_seconds": 319.18,
      "duration_seconds": 3.99,
      "text": "Any problem with feeling in your hand?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 321.35,
      "end_seconds": 324.69,
      "duration_seconds": 3.34,
      "text": "No, nothing, it's all normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 326.3,
      "end_seconds": 329.61,
      "duration_seconds": 3.31,
      "text": "Any problem with your breathing?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 330.78,
      "end_seconds": 332.23,
      "duration_seconds": 1.45,
      "text": "No, nothing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 333.75,
      "end_seconds": 342.65,
      "duration_seconds": 8.9,
      "text": "Here's what I think. The fracture is healing well so far, from how it looks and feels."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 343.56,
      "end_seconds": 345.46,
      "duration_seconds": 1.9,
      "text": "That's great. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 348.07,
      "end_seconds": 358.62,
      "duration_seconds": 10.55,
      "text": "Next week, before the cast comes off, I'd like to arrange an X-ray of the wrist, to see the bone."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 359.66,
      "end_seconds": 363.8,
      "duration_seconds": 4.14,
      "text": "That's what I was hoping. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 365.86,
      "end_seconds": 378.7,
      "duration_seconds": 12.84,
      "text": "Given your thin bones and family history, I'd also like to arrange a bone density scan, and a vitamin D blood test."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 379.95,
      "end_seconds": 382.88,
      "duration_seconds": 2.93,
      "text": "Goodness, the full works. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 384.94,
      "end_seconds": 393.77,
      "duration_seconds": 8.83,
      "text": "Better to be thorough. I'd like to see you again next week to take the cast off."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0056",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 395.89,
      "end_seconds": 400.53,
      "duration_seconds": 4.64,
      "text": "Next week. I'll bring a cake. ~"
    }
  ]
}
